Abyssinia. And what we know of this guy, Casa, he was born in 1818 or thereabouts, so he's probably in his mid-30s at this point. He has an obscure background. He seems to have been educated in a monastery, which was attacked by bandits, and then he escaped. He became an outlaw himself, a kind of bandit leader. But no hint, no hint that he's descended from a biblical king. No, at this point, no hint that he's descended from Solomon. Although, of course, he will claim dissent from Solomon later, of course. So Kasa is a sort of bold, courageous, charismatic man. He's obviously a good leader of men. He beats one rival after another in the 1840s, early 1850s. Then in January 1855, he beats his last major rival and he assembles all his troops and he says,
阿比西尼亚北部。关于这个叫卡萨的家伙，我们知道他出生于1818年左右，所以此时他大概30多岁。他出身卑微。他似乎是在一座修道院受的教育，修道院遭到土匪袭击，然后他逃了出来。他自己也成了亡命之徒，一种土匪头子。但没有任何迹象，没有任何迹象表明他是圣经中国王的后裔。不，此时没有任何迹象表明他是所罗门的后裔。尽管当然，他后来会声称自己是所罗门的后裔。所以卡萨是一个大胆、勇敢、有魅力的人。他显然是一个优秀的领导者。他在19世纪40年代、50年代初击败了一个又一个对手。然后在1855年1月，他击败了最后一个主要对手，召集了他所有的军队，他说，

