Yeah, he's kind of King Arthur figure who reigned around the same time that Henry V was winning the Battle of Agincourt for about nine months. And James Bruce, an explorer in the 19th century, He said there must have been something very brilliant that happened under this prince, but no one can remember what it is. Yeah. So, anyway, this guy, Kasa, now Teotros, is the protagonist of our story.
是的，他是一个类似亚瑟王的人物，统治时间大约在亨利五世赢得阿金库尔战役的时候，统治了大约九个月。詹姆斯·布鲁斯，19世纪的一位探险家，他说这位王子统治下一定发生过非常辉煌的事情，但没人记得是什么了。是的。总之，这个叫卡萨，现在叫提奥多罗斯的人，是我们故事的主角。

