So that's nice. And he's absolutely fascinated by the outside world. So he loves meeting travellers. He loves hearing about Britain and France. He's obsessed with the Crimean War. That's something that will be coming up on the rest of his history before the end of the year, isn't it? We'll be doing a series about the Crimean War. So Teodros would have loved that because when travellers come, he always sort of says,
