But the Crimean way fascinates him and bewilders him. He cannot get his head around the fact that Christian Britain and France are allied with Muslim, the Muslim Turkey, the Ottoman Empire, against another Christian power, Russia. He really struggles to comprehend that and that makes him wonder whether the British are quite as devoted to Christianity as they should be. Anyway, a year later, end of 1856, he has the highest ranking visitor he would ever receive
但克里米亚战争让他着迷又困惑。他无法理解基督教的英国和法国竟然与穆斯林土耳其、奥斯曼帝国结盟，去对抗另一个基督教大国俄罗斯。他真的很难理解这一点，这让他怀疑英国人是否像他们应该的那样忠于基督教。总之，一年后，1856年底，他接待了他有史以来最高级别的访客，

