00:18:53.000 --> 00:19:21.000
and this is the Coptic patriarch Cyril IV who is the sort of spiritual father of the Ethiopian church and he comes to visit from Alexandria and Cyril turns up and he is very, very down on Abyssinia and Renegis practice Cyril says, look, you have far too many holidays, holy days. You have far too many saints and they're all wrong. Your calendar is bonkers, all of this. And Teodros, he's completely conforms to Plowden's picture of him because he,
