00:19:54.000 --> 00:20:15.000
Which they're not, to be fair to the English. No, which they're not, which they're absolutely not. But this is a thread that will run through this story. I think because the Abyssinians have been so isolated for so long, they have got it into their heads that their neighbors are all plotting to sell them out or undermine. or undermine them or conquer them or whatever. I suppose to be fair to him. I mean, the British do have a certain track record in. They do.
而他们并没有，对英国人来说公平点。不，他们没有，他们绝对没有。但这将是贯穿这个故事的一条线索。我认为因为阿比西尼亚人被孤立了太久，他们已经认定他们的邻居都在密谋出卖他们，或者削弱他们，或者征服他们等等。我想对他公平点。我的意思是，英国人确实有一定的记录。他们确实有。

