Well, I mean, at this point, if you listen to the French, they do. But Teodros is actually still quite devoted to the British. He still crazed their approval. He recognises that they're the most powerful, the richest, the most modern country on earth. And so when the patriarch leaves, he takes with him two letters. And one of them was dictated by Teodros himself. And this was a letter dictated to quix. Queen Victoria. May this letter sent by the King of Kings Teodros of Ethiopia reach the Queen of England, Victoria.
好吧，我的意思是，在这一点上，如果你听法国人的，他们确实有。但提奥多罗斯实际上仍然相当忠于英国人。他仍然渴望他们的认可。他承认他们是地球上最强大、最富有、最现代的国家。所以当牧首离开时，他带走了两封信。其中一封是由提奥多罗斯本人口述的。这是写给维多利亚女王的信。愿这封由埃塞俄比亚万王之王提奥多罗斯寄出的信到达英国女王维多利亚手中。

